OL,3,GNEWSAApplause in court as father of
OL,4,Amurdered teen warns killer 'prison will
OL,5,Anot go well'
OL,6,
OL,7,FApplause could be heard in court as the
OL,8,Ffather of a 17-year-old boy murdered by
OL,9,Fa teenage drug courier described him as
OL,10,Fa child killer and warned "prison would
OL,11,Fnot go well" for him.
OL,13,FKaine Kerr's son, Tristan Kerr, from
OL,14,FAbertridwr, Caerphilly county, died
OL,15,Ffrom a single 13.3cm (5.25in) deep stab
OL,16,Fwound to the heart and lung in
OL,17,FFebruary.
OL,23,APub: 18-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
FL,432,430,260,140,0,100
