OL,3,GNEWSAApplause in court as father of
OL,4,Amurdered teen warns killer 'prison will
OL,5,Anot go well'
OL,6,
OL,7,FHis killer, 19-year-old Georgie Mears,
OL,8,Ffrom Cardiff, claimed he was acting in
OL,9,Fself defence, telling Newport Crown
OL,10,FCourt: "I'm terribly sorry. I didn't
OL,11,Fmean to kill him."
OL,13,FOn Wednesday, Mears was sentenced to a
OL,14,Fminumum of 20 years and six months in
OL,15,Fprison, minus 282 days spent on remand.
OL,16,FHe will be on licence for the rest of
OL,17,Fhis life.
OL,23,APub: 18-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
